{"seq":3,"slug":"pluralization-gender-grammar","title":"复数化与语法适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/pluralization-gender-grammar","wordCount":1538,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"复数化与语法适配\">复数化与语法适配</h1><p>英语只有两种复数形式（1 item / 2 items），但阿拉伯语有六种、波兰语有四种、日语没有复数变化。后端消息格式化如果只按英语模型设计 <code>if count == 1 then singular else plural</code>，在扩展到其他语言时必然崩溃。正确的方案是使用 CLDR 复数规则和结构化消息格式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CLDR 六类别系统</strong>：zero / one / two / few / many / other，每种语言映射到其子集</li>\n<li><strong>复数规则是数学表达式</strong>：不是简单数值范围，而是基于模运算（如波兰语 <code>n%10∈{2,3,4} ∧ n%100∉{12,13,14}</code> → few）</li>\n<li><strong>序数词规则独立于基数词</strong>：英语 ordinal 的 st/nd/rd/th 后缀由 <code>n%10</code> 和 <code>n%100</code> 联合决定</li>\n<li><strong>消息设计原则</strong>：翻译完整句子而非拼接片段，允许翻译者自由重排变量位置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cldr-复数规则系统\">CLDR 复数规则系统</h2><p>Unicode CLDR 定义了六个复数类别（plural categories），每种语言映射到其中的子集：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>英语示例</th>\n<th>阿拉伯语示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>zero</td>\n<td>零量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>0 كتب</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>one</td>\n<td>单数/特殊形式</td>\n<td>1 item</td>\n<td>1 كتاب</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>two</td>\n<td>双数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>2 كتابان</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>few</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>3-10 كتب</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>many</td>\n<td>大量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>11-99 كتابًا</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>other</td>\n<td>其余所有</td>\n<td>0, 2+ items</td>\n<td>100+ كتاب</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察：复数类别的选择规则<strong>不是简单的数值范围</strong>，而是基于数学表达式。波兰语的规则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>category</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>one</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>few</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>100</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>12</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>many</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∧</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∨</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>5..9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∨</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>100</mn><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>12..14</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>other</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{category}(n) = \\begin{cases}\n\\text{one} &amp; \\text{if } n = 1 \\\\\n\\text{few} &amp; \\text{if } n \\bmod 10 \\in \\{2,3,4\\} \\land n \\bmod 100 \\notin \\{12,13,14\\} \\\\\n\\text{many} &amp; \\text{if } n \\neq 1 \\land n \\bmod 10 \\in \\{0,1\\} \\lor n \\bmod 10 \\in \\{5..9\\} \\lor n \\bmod 100 \\in \\{12..14\\} \\\\\n\\text{other} &amp; \\text{otherwise}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">one</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">few</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">many</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">other</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">5..9</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">12..14</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各语言使用的复数类别数量差异巨大：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;1 form (no plural)&quot;&#10;        A[日语 中文 韩语 越南语&lt;br/&gt;只用 other]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;2 forms&quot;&#10;        B[英语 德语 荷兰语&lt;br/&gt;one + other]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;3 forms&quot;&#10;        C[法语 拉脱维亚语&lt;br/&gt;one + two/few + other]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;4 forms&quot;&#10;        D[波兰语 克罗地亚语&lt;br/&gt;one + few + many + other]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;6 forms&quot;&#10;        E[阿拉伯语&lt;br/&gt;zero+one+two+few+many+other]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"1 form (no plural)\"\n        A[日语 中文 韩语 越南语&lt;br/&gt;只用 other]\n    end\n    subgraph \"2 forms\"\n        B[英语 德语 荷兰语&lt;br/&gt;one + other]\n    end\n    subgraph \"3 forms\"\n        C[法语 拉脱维亚语&lt;br/&gt;one + two/few + other]\n    end\n    subgraph \"4 forms\"\n        D[波兰语 克罗地亚语&lt;br/&gt;one + few + many + other]\n    end\n    subgraph \"6 forms\"\n        E[阿拉伯语&lt;br/&gt;zero+one+two+few+many+other]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"后端复数化实现\">后端复数化实现</h2><p>后端实现复数化有两个层次：底层的规则引擎和上层的消息格式。</p>\n<p><strong>底层：CLDR plural rules 引擎</strong></p>\n<p>ICU4X 的 <code>icu_plurals</code> crate 提供了 CLDR 复数规则的 Rust 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use icu::plurals::{PluralCategory, PluralRules};&#10;use icu::locale::locale;&#10;&#10;let rules = PluralRules::try_new_cardinal(locale!(&quot;ar&quot;).into())&#10;    .expect(&quot;locale data available&quot;);&#10;&#10;assert_eq!(rules.category_for(0), PluralCategory::Zero);&#10;assert_eq!(rules.category_for(1), PluralCategory::One);&#10;assert_eq!(rules.category_for(2), PluralCategory::Two);&#10;assert_eq!(rules.category_for(5), PluralCategory::Few);&#10;assert_eq!(rules.category_for(11), PluralCategory::Many);&#10;assert_eq!(rules.category_for(100), PluralCategory::Other);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use icu::plurals::{PluralCategory, PluralRules};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use icu::locale::locale;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let rules = PluralRules::try_new_cardinal(locale!(\"ar\").into())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .expect(\"locale data available\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert_eq!(rules.category_for(0), PluralCategory::Zero);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert_eq!(rules.category_for(1), PluralCategory::One);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert_eq!(rules.category_for(2), PluralCategory::Two);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert_eq!(rules.category_for(5), PluralCategory::Few);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert_eq!(rules.category_for(11), PluralCategory::Many);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert_eq!(rules.category_for(100), PluralCategory::Other);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>上层：MessageFormat 消息模板</strong></p>\n<p>ICU MessageFormat 1（当前生产主流）的复数语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{count, plural,&#10;  zero {لا توجد رسائل}&#10;  one {رسالة واحدة}&#10;  two {رسالتان}&#10;  few {{count} رسائل}&#10;  many {{count} رسالة}&#10;  other {{count} رسالة}&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{count, plural,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  zero {لا توجد رسائل}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  one {رسالة واحدة}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  two {رسالتان}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  few {{count} رسائل}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  many {{count} رسالة}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  other {{count} رسالة}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MessageFormat 2.0 的等价写法（spec stable, 2025 年 LDML 47/48 锁定语义）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\".input {$count :integer}&#10;.match $count&#10;  0     {{لا توجد رسائل}}&#10;  one   {{رسالة واحدة}}&#10;  two   {{رسالتان}}&#10;  few   {{{$count} رسائل}}&#10;  many  {{{$count} رسالة}}&#10;  *     {{{$count} رسالة}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.input {$count :integer}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.match $count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  0     {{لا توجد رسائل}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  one   {{رسالة واحدة}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  two   {{رسالتان}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  few   {{{$count} رسائل}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  many  {{{$count} رسالة}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  *     {{{$count} رسالة}}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"序数词-ordinal\">序数词（Ordinal）</h2><p>序数词（第 1、第 2、第 3...）的规则与基数词不同。英语的序数后缀：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>后缀</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1, 21, 31...</td>\n<td>st</td>\n<td><code>n % 10 == 1 &amp;&amp; n % 100 != 11</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2, 22, 32...</td>\n<td>nd</td>\n<td><code>n % 10 == 2 &amp;&amp; n % 100 != 12</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3, 23, 33...</td>\n<td>rd</td>\n<td><code>n % 10 == 3 &amp;&amp; n % 100 != 13</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>其余</td>\n<td>th</td>\n<td>other</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CLDR 同样为序数词定义了 plural rules（通过 <code>ordinal</code> 类型）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Node.js: Intl.PluralRules 的 ordinal 类型&#10;const ordinal = new Intl.PluralRules(&#39;en&#39;, { type: &#39;ordinal&#39; });&#10;ordinal.select(1); // &quot;one&quot;  → 1st&#10;ordinal.select(2); // &quot;two&quot;  → 2nd&#10;ordinal.select(3); // &quot;few&quot;  → 3rd&#10;ordinal.select(4); // &quot;other&quot; → 4th&#10;ordinal.select(21); // &quot;one&quot;  → 21st\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Node.js: Intl.PluralRules 的 ordinal 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ordinal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Intl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PluralRules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'en'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ordinal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ordinal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"one\"  → 1st</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ordinal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"two\"  → 2nd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ordinal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"few\"  → 3rd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ordinal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"other\" → 4th</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ordinal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"one\"  → 21st</span></span></code></pre></div><p>后端在生成排名文本（&quot;您是第 {n} 名完成的用户&quot;）时必须使用 ordinal plural rules 而非 cardinal——两者的类别映射在某些语言中完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性别语法适配\">性别语法适配</h2><p>许多语言的名词、形容词、代词需要根据语法性别变化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>性别系统</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>法语</td>\n<td>阴性/阳性</td>\n<td>冠词、形容词、过去分词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>德语</td>\n<td>阴/阳/中</td>\n<td>冠词、形容词词尾、代词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阿拉伯语</td>\n<td>阴/阳</td>\n<td>动词、形容词、数词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波兰语</td>\n<td>阴/阳/中 (+ 人格阳性)</td>\n<td>动词过去时、形容词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英语</td>\n<td>仅代词</td>\n<td>he/she/they</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后端消息模板处理性别的标准方式是 ICU <code>select</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{gender, select,&#10;  male {{name} a mis à jour son profil.}&#10;  female {{name} a mis à jour son profil.}&#10;  other {{name} a mis à jour son profil.}&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{gender, select,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  male {{name} a mis à jour son profil.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  female {{name} a mis à jour son profil.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  other {{name} a mis à jour son profil.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>法语的微妙之处——上面看起来相同，实际 &quot;son&quot; 要随所有物的性别变化（不是人的性别）。这说明简单的 <code>gender</code> 变量往往不够——复杂语言需要更细粒度的语法信息。</p>\n<p><strong>CLDR Person Names 格式化</strong>（ICU 76+ / ICU4X 实验性支持）提供了新的人名格式化 API，处理不同文化中姓/名顺序、敬称、缩写的差异——这比简单的 <code>{firstName} {lastName}</code> 模板可靠得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"格变化-case-declension\">格变化（Case Declension）</h2><p>斯拉夫语系（俄语、波兰语、捷克语等）和芬兰-乌戈尔语系（芬兰语、匈牙利语）有丰富的名词格变化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;俄语名词 &#39;книга&#39; (book)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;主格: книга&lt;br/&gt;(subject)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;宾格: книгу&lt;br/&gt;(object)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;属格: книги&lt;br/&gt;(possession)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;与格: книге&lt;br/&gt;(to/for)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;工具格: книгой&lt;br/&gt;(with/by)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; G[&quot;前置格: книге&lt;br/&gt;(about/in)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"俄语名词 'книга' (book)\"] --&gt; B[\"主格: книга&lt;br/&gt;(subject)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"宾格: книгу&lt;br/&gt;(object)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"属格: книги&lt;br/&gt;(possession)\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"与格: книге&lt;br/&gt;(to/for)\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"工具格: книгой&lt;br/&gt;(with/by)\"]\n    A --&gt; G[\"前置格: книге&lt;br/&gt;(about/in)\"]</pre><p>当后端消息需要在句子中插入一个名词（如产品名、城市名）时，该名词可能需要根据句法位置变化词形。例如俄语：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;已添加<strong>电脑</strong>到购物车&quot; → &quot;Добавлен <strong>компьютер</strong> в корзину&quot;（主格）</li>\n<li>&quot;价格包含<strong>电脑</strong>&quot; → &quot;Цена включает <strong>компьютер</strong>&quot;（宾格，此处恰好同形）</li>\n<li>&quot;购买<strong>电脑</strong>的人&quot; → &quot;Покупатели <strong>компьютера</strong>&quot;（属格）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>后端解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>避免在句子中插入名词</strong>——重构消息使名词不需要变化（&quot;购物车中的商品：{productName}&quot;，名词作独立标签出现）</li>\n<li><strong>预计算所有格形式</strong>——为需要插入句中的名词存储所有格变体</li>\n<li><strong>使用 CLDR inflection 数据</strong>（实验性，CLDR 43+ 部分覆盖）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"数量与单位的语法交互\">数量与单位的语法交互</h2><p>复数规则与单位名词的交互产生组合爆炸。俄语示例 &quot;X файлов&quot;（X 个文件）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数值</th>\n<th>复数类别</th>\n<th>俄语格变化</th>\n<th>完整文本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>one</td>\n<td>файл（主格单数）</td>\n<td>1 файл</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>few</td>\n<td>файла（属格单数）</td>\n<td>2 файла</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>many</td>\n<td>файлов（属格复数）</td>\n<td>5 файлов</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>one</td>\n<td>файл（主格单数）</td>\n<td>21 файл</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.5</td>\n<td>other</td>\n<td>файла（属格单数）</td>\n<td>1,5 файла</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 <code>n=21</code> 又回到 <code>one</code> 类别（因为 <code>21 % 10 == 1 &amp;&amp; 21 % 100 != 11</code>）。后端的 plural rules 引擎必须正确实现这些模运算规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践-消息设计原则\">最佳实践：消息设计原则</h2><p>后端消息模板的设计直接影响翻译质量和可维护性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n<th>错误做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整句子</td>\n<td>翻译一个完整句子</td>\n<td>拼接片段 <code>&quot;You have &quot; + n + &quot; items&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免假设语序</td>\n<td><code>{count, plural, one {...} other {...}}</code></td>\n<td><code>count + &quot; &quot; + unit</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不复用翻译</td>\n<td>不同上下文用不同 key</td>\n<td>一个翻译在按钮和标题中复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为翻译者提供上下文</td>\n<td>标注变量类型和范围</td>\n<td>裸 key 无注释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试极端值</td>\n<td>0, 1, 2, 5, 21, 100</td>\n<td>只测 1 和 2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>字符串拼接是 i18n 反模式的根源</strong>。后端代码中任何 <code>&quot;Hello &quot; + name</code> 式的拼接都应重构为参数化模板。这不仅是为了翻译——拼接还会在 RTL 语言中产生方向性错误（相关内容见<a href=\"../operations/rtl-bidirectional-support\">RTL 与双向文本支持</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>复数化和语法适配是后端 i18n 中最容易被「英语思维」低估的领域。CLDR 的六类别系统和基于模运算的规则引擎提供了语言学正确的基础；ICU MessageFormat（1 或 2.0）和 <code>icu_plurals</code> 将这些规则封装为开发者可用的 API。消息设计的核心原则是翻译完整句子而非拼接片段——这一条同时解决了复数、语序和 RTL 方向性三类问题。性别和格变化增加了消息组合的复杂度，最务实的策略是尽量避免在句子中插入需要变形的名词。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复数化与语法适配","id":"复数化与语法适配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CLDR 复数规则系统","id":"cldr-复数规则系统"},{"level":2,"text":"后端复数化实现","id":"后端复数化实现"},{"level":2,"text":"序数词（Ordinal）","id":"序数词-ordinal"},{"level":2,"text":"性别语法适配","id":"性别语法适配"},{"level":2,"text":"格变化（Case Declension）","id":"格变化-case-declension"},{"level":2,"text":"数量与单位的语法交互","id":"数量与单位的语法交互"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践：消息设计原则","id":"最佳实践-消息设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动态内容本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/dynamic-content-localization"},"next":{"title":"国际化测试与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-testing-automation"}}